  "notes": [
    "Terminal designations for the *SR start relay (1,2,5) taken from the ladder diagram; connection diagram numbering partially obscured.",
    "The dashed lines from thermostat Y/G/R and the indoor blower motor to the external 24V supply are drawn as field/interconnect wiring; exact landing terminals at the transformer/blower block are ambiguous — thermostat-to-solenoid and blower interconnect traced conservatively.",
