    "Right edge of the page (Note #8, *SR area) and the NOTES column text are cropped/partially illegible.",
    "CTD internal logic (T1/T2/T3 to LOGIC block) shown schematically; internal contact-to-logic wiring not individually traced beyond the three external terminals.",
